7. Termination

   Breach: Your rights under this license will terminate automatically
   without notice if you fail to comply with any terms of this Agreement
   (such as distributing unauthorized cracks to unlock the belts beyond the
   first three).

   Refunds: The premium license ends if your payment is refunded or reversed,
   including by chargeback. The free tier remains available.

   Effect: Upon termination for breach, you must cease all use of the
   Software and delete all copies from your devices.
